acceptance:
Negative controls in the same test file each still refuse with registered_check_root_rebound or the existing refusal:
- a different path;
- changed or dirty source;
- another work item, run or store;
- a missing or incoherent receipt or body digest;
- a newer applicable terminal non-pass or unknown result;
- an empty bindings list alone.
The existing tests a_new_naming_generation_does_not_reuse_the_original_evidence and the root_rebind tests keep their protection for every case outside this narrow lane.
